@5639. Many Jesuits (can make themselves Angels of light).

@5844[4]. Therefore (Benedict XIV) loved and honoured the Jesuits... @5846[end]. @LJPost 103.

@6027[8]. The Ex-Czar Peter... had two disguised Jesuits with him... who secretly tried to bring him over to the Catholics.

@DMin 4567. Anthony uses the ministry of the white Jesuits.

@4573. On the white Jesuits.

@--. There are Jesuits who wanted, in the life of the body, to obtain all things by prayers, in order that they might thus command others... They appear small, with bright white clothing, in front near the earth, a little to the left. They descend into their Hell by ladders... They ascended, and then were standing in order with their books in their hands, reading. They can deceive infants; but their reading and praying regards themselves...

@AE 1044. The interiors... with the Jesuits... appeared so empty that they did not know a single truth which leads to Heaven...

@LJPost 68. See <Ignatius>.

